+// c2i_ASN1_INTEGER decodes |len| bytes from |*inp| as the contents of a
+// DER-encoded INTEGER, excluding the tag and length. It behaves like
+// |d2i_SAMPLE_with_reuse| except, on success, it always consumes all |len|
+// bytes.
